<title>NORWAY: Elkem Q1 pre-tax profits tumble 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Elkem Q1 pre-tax profits tumble 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating income		   261    vs	    343</p>
<p>  Profits before tax		 237    vs	    312</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian metals producer is Elkem ASA. A Reuter poll of nine analysts forecast an operating result of 231 million crowns and pre-tax profits of 223 million crowns.  </p>
<p>Net sales			  2,210	   vs	  2,383</p>
<p>Net profit			   164	   vs	    230</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
